  "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"496\">Beleef de spanning van de Formule 1 met <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"326\">F1 2019 – Anniversary Edition</strong> voor <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"349\">PlayStation 4</strong>. Race tegen de beste coureurs ter wereld in officiële F1-teams en ervaar realistische graphics, strakke gameplay en alle circuits van het seizoen.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"648\">Deze game is <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"529\">in goede staat</strong> en <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"563\">volledig getest op werking</strong>. Inclusief originele hoes (indien van toepassing) en geschikt voor elke PS4-console.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"796\">✅ Officiële F1-racegame met alle teams & circuits<br data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"702\">✅ Anniversary Edition met extra content<br data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"744\">✅ Disc in goede staat<br data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"768\">✅ 1 week garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"831\"><strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"831\">Vandaag besteld = snel racen!</strong></p>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"898\">📋 <strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"898\">Specificaties – F1 2019 Anniversary Edition – PS4</strong></h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"934\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"918\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"971\">🏁 <strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"950\">Genre:</strong> Racing / Simulatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1022\">👥 <strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"993\">Multiplayer:</strong> Ja – online & split-screen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1065\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1043\">Uitvoering:</strong> Anniversary Edition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1116\">💽 <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1080\">Disc:</strong> In goede staat, getest en werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1182\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1132\">Staat:</strong> In goede staat – lichte gebruikssporen mogelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1218\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1202\">Garantie:</strong> 1 week garantie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
